40
00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.460
mis just juhtus sellel hetkel ma
olin, ma olin teadvuseta mingi aeg.

41
00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.640
Ma ei tea.

42
00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.880
Stinne,
